    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 7 Rockingham is a beautifully fully refurbished three-bedroom mid-terraced home located in the heart of Newcastle village. Extending to approximately 99 sq. m, this home has been finished to a high standard throughout and offers bright, comfortable living space ideally suited to the modern family life..\n\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, with a door leading to the rear garden. A guest WC and a useful storage room are conveniently located off the main living space. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a fully fitted family bathroom.\n\nRockingham is a charming courtyard-style development of refurbished 1, 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes. Each property has been carefully upgraded to deliver contemporary comfort while retaining a sense of character and community.\n\nLocated in the quiet, peaceful village of Newcastle, Rockingham is thoughtfully laid out, offering a balance between the peace of coastal, country and city living. Rockingham is located at the heart of Newcastle offering easy access to shops, services and amenities. Travel to Dublin City on the train with regular services from Kilcoole station and DART in Greystones. Make your morning commute to Connolly Station in under an hour with the sea as your constant companion. Connect to the south and north of the country with convenient access to the M11, which links with the M50 taking you to major destinations around Ireland.\n\nPlease Note: \n\nThis property qualifies for the Help To Buy Scheme.\n\nThis property does not qualify for the First Home Scheme.\n\nThere is no construction guarantee available."
      },
